OL,3,AStrong winds and thunderstorms kick off
OL,4,Athe bank holiday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter weeks of scorching heat and
OL,7,Fdrought the summer's swan song is set
OL,8,Fto be one of frequent downpours as well
OL,9,Fas gales for some.
OL,11,FAreas of heavy rain and showers are
OL,12,Fexpected to sweep across parts of the
OL,13,FUK on each day of the weekend, which is
OL,14,Fa bank holiday for many.
OL,16,FThis could make for some soggy moments
OL,17,Fat many of the festivals taking place
OL,18,Fover the coming days.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
